&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Customer Accounts Receivable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
