&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Utility &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;Plant accruals were $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;0.1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; million at December 31, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; an&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;d $0.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; million at December 31, 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Gross additions to Utility Plant (less &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;PAD Gas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;) on the Statement of Cash Flows excludes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;insignificant &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;non-cash transactions in 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; and $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; million in 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;The total amount of AFUDC included in the Statement of Income was insignificant in 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;5 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;and 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;The composite weighted-average depreciation rates were &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;2.5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;% &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;2.60%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;, respectively&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;7. Risk Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Credit Risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Our principal customers for natural gas storage services are industrial end-users, municipalities, gas &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;marketers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; and natural gas and electric utilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;located&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; in Tennessee, Virginia, and North Carolina. We have concentrations of receivables from these sectors throughout these regions. These concentrations of customers may affect our overall credit risk in that risk factors can negatively affect the credit quality of the entire sector. Where exposed to credit risk, we analyze the customers&amp;#8217; financial condition prior to entering into an agreement, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;establish&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; credit limits and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;monitor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; the appropriateness of those limits on an ongoing basis. We also obtain parental guarantees, cash deposits, or letters of credit from customers to provide credit support, where &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;appropriate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;, based on our financial analysis of the customer and the regulatory or contractual terms and conditions applicable to each contract.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;8. Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
