&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Income taxes are accrued in accordance with the FERC Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowance permitting the accrual of income taxes on a pass-through entity and the associated taxes accrued are treated as deemed contri&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;butions from the owners, whereas net operating loss carryovers are treated as deemed distributions. The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;deemed contribution recorded was $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;3.6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; million in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; and $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;0.9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; million in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; and was included within Other Paid-in Capital in the Comparative Balance Sheet. We will make all necessary adjustments to account balances upon a ruling in Docket No. AC18-220-000. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;On December 22, 2017, the United States enacted the &amp;#8220;Tax Cuts and Jobs Act&amp;#8221; (&amp;#8220;TCJA &amp;#8221;). The changes in the TCJA are effective for taxation years beginning after December 31, 2017. While the changes are broad and complex, the most significant change is the reduction in the corporate federal income tax rate from 35% to 21%. We recorded a $10.8 million decrease to our 2017 deferred income tax liability, a $3.7 million increase to our 2017 deferred income tax asset and an offsetting increase of $14.5 million to our regulatory liability. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;In 2018 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;pursuant to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; guidance &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;established&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; in FERC Docket No. PL19-2-000, we began amortizing the regulated liability &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;utilizing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; the reverse South Georgia flowback &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;methodology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; over the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;23.0 year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; remaining life of the assets. In &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;, we recorded a $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;0.6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; million decrease to regulatory liability, a $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;0.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; million &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;decrease&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; to our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; deferred income tax asset and an &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;offsetting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;0.5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; million benefit to our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; deferred federal &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;tax expense. In 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;, we recorded a $0.6 million decrease to regulatory liability, a $0.1 million decrease to our 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; deferred income tax &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;asset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; and an offsetting $0.5 million benefit to our 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; deferred federal tax expense. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;9. Related Party Transactions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Related party transactions are provided in the normal course of business and, unless otherwise noted, are measured at the exchange amount, which is the amount of consideration established and agreed to by the related parties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;In the normal course of business, we provide natural gas transportation services to affiliates of Enbridge and our members. In addition, Enbridge and its affiliates provide management and operating services to us, pursuant to agreements entered into with us. We reimburse Enbridge for the expenses incurred to provide these services, as well as for other expenses incurred on our behalf.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Enbridge affiliates charge such expenses based on the cost of actual services provided or using various allocation methodologies based on our percentage of assets, employees, earnings, or other measures compared to other Enbridge affiliates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Our transactions with related parties are as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
