&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;In addition to the balances discussed above, we also carry investment advances to associated companies. These investment advances do not bear interest and are carried as unsecured, open accounts in account 123 or 223. Increases and decreases in these investment advances generally result from the movement of funds under our cash management agreement with SEP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
